{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>自由身模特兒Toby Kong一向都活躍於社交平台，不定時發放福利照，其實平時她已經十分性感，但昨日（15日）她分享了一輯全裸的照片，尺度大膽。她寫下：「Thank you so much.」還標籤了麥浚龍，她分享的相片中還有一隻手，在按著她的頭，未知這隻手的主人是否就是麥浚龍。</p><figure><img alt=\"Toby Kong分享了一輯全裸的照。(ig@toby_kong)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176720282958827520024138.jpeg/PsvrprR8tKsjJn4EGt8-oMRUihhc_uIUJt6aASbemgE\"/><figcaption>Toby Kong分享了一輯全裸的照。(ig@toby_kong)</figcaption></figure><p>Toby Kong是麥浚龍與陳蕾新歌《不下床》的MV女主角</p><p>原來Toby Kong是麥浚龍與陳蕾新歌《不下床》的MV女主角，她在MV中全裸上陣，側身躺在床上。之後有一隻疑似是麥浚龍的手在她的赤裸的身上用兩隻手指跳舞，這兩隻手指遊遍Toby全身，由手臂到膊頭再到屁股及腳踝，整個MV都帶點唯美感。不過就有粉絲留言表示：「咸咸地」、「一定唔係麥俊（浚）龍隻手」、「和伴侶都不願下床 只想懶洋洋纏綿 歇息一下 多好」。</p><figure><img alt=\"Toby Kong尺度大膽。(ig@toby_kong)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176720280618274816682013.jpeg/SdcGDnHrrFVQ482_BgaT7_JDgQhpLxG4aIVwCmiFcAo\"/><figcaption>Toby Kong尺度大膽。(ig@toby_kong)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toby Kong同麥浚龍合照。(ig@toby_kong)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176720290903232512789130.jpeg/8jWze2AAh9jCnmSJjOKzExZE4Qitht8vkhvoxpIb6MY\"/><figcaption>Toby Kong同麥浚龍合照。(ig@toby_kong)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"MV女主角Toby Kong。(MV截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176739760929378304287694.jpeg/Gz-joDCMZoz0S7wFErmXvWMTWK4We-8MhhOcbYYTnG0\"/><figcaption>MV女主角Toby Kong。(MV截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"呢隻手到底係邊個？(MV截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176739758312001536486195.jpeg/a4EtKSo5aCw25dERZto0GVZ1b775PWnlvg1AA74NQAM\"/><figcaption>呢隻手到底係邊個？(MV截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"呢隻神秘的手喺Toby身上起舞。(MV截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176739756084695040971845.jpeg/cvNi6C2pmz2AJgkROq9_C7NZVPv1am9KsV12eLFddng\"/><figcaption>呢隻神秘的手喺Toby身上起舞。(MV截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"連pat pat都有經過。(MV截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176739753769308160609583.jpeg/5IMOsGCY7s91J-2P40aww2F6qkcq03Am5b9twOW_bcA\"/><figcaption>連pat pat都有經過。(MV截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民估隻手唔係JUNO。(網頁截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176740009236107264574382.png/knto10djd2UAGRhBbkgcxSc1-mde4Mavd2KTV3dik1c\"/><figcaption>網民估隻手唔係JUNO。(網頁截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民覺得有少少咸。(網頁截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176740007163990016954701.png/-cHzU41KSC1YOmRX4LC12ROvRI3-Zo0mqhW0daoVtHU\"/><figcaption>網民覺得有少少咸。(網頁截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toby Kong大方post性感相。(ig@toby_kong)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176720288415879168742935.jpeg/HgF335dKwrh5LmqLzifHGTAvfD2gnw4y8HydNPB8nTQ\"/><figcaption>Toby Kong大方post性感相。(ig@toby_kong)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toby Kong有時都會好sexy。(ig@toby_kong)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176720286243098624948270.jpeg/8-rU70bb3fzES8VOXu8bXm3Tdp6deXG91L8hmNS_IZg\"/><figcaption>Toby Kong有時都會好sexy。(ig@toby_kong)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toby Kong有時都會好sexy。(ig@toby_kong)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176720283952877568514628.jpeg/Zk69ZcbWLG8p-qFbqmuoP-hgYh0mw7ihSx9kQEsfZEA\"/><figcaption>Toby Kong有時都會好sexy。(ig@toby_kong)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Toby Kong不定時發放福利照。(ig@toby_kong)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176720281847205888607958.jpeg/oc5B1kkp7B1JVZG5OuFJel-M9P2S6VhEiP3894j9_Pc\"/><figcaption>Toby Kong不定時發放福利照。(ig@toby_kong)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T03:39:23.435695+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":692,"images":13,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}